    "config_seed": 2026,
    "mechanism": "FrankaSkinHybridObstacleConfig carries a fixed seed. Each worker constructs its own task sampler (pipeline.py: 'create task sampler once for this worker'), and TaskSampler.__init__ calls seed_task_sampling(seed), which seeds random, np.random and torch globally with that same value. The seed depends on neither worker id nor house index, and every configured house index is congruent to 1 mod 24 so all houses are the identical red-cup task. The k-th house processed by any worker therefore replays the same episode sequence.",
